      "mergeID": "66d9dc18cd08be46e4af2950",
      "mergedPostDetails": "We received the methods for creating textures, render textures, etc, but exempt from all that are CustomRenderTextures, and the requisite Material creation. Exposing these would allow certain prefabs to be placed in a world multiple times without conflict. It would also allow dynamic resizing for custom render textures.",
